    "name_raw": "Taskmaster",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Advanced Race Guide pg. 124",
    "definition_raw": "Source Advanced Race Guide pg. 124\nYou intimidate weaker allies into reckless ferocity.\n\nPrerequisites: Demoralizing Lash, Intimidate 5 ranks, hobgoblin.\n\nBenefit: As a standard action, you spur an ally, who must have fewer Hit Dice than yourself, to reckless effort. For 1 minute, the ally gains a +1 morale bonus on attack rolls, weapon damage rolls, and Will saves against mind-affecting effects. However, the ally also takes a –2 penalty to AC and on skill checks. To affect an unwilling ally, you must succeed at an Intimidate check with the same DC used to demoralize your ally.\n\nSpecial: If you have 10 or more ranks in Intimidate, the morale bonus increases to +2.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
        "anchor_text_raw": "Advanced Race Guide pg. 124",
